      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958203
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-24T18:04:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is to mimic the API of le_impl. FWIW, if you call add_to_direct_list multiple times, it will correctly batch the operations together, so there\u0027s no inefficiency there (just inelegance).\n\nI don\u0027t want to make major changes to le_impl at least until I get this working, then we can refactor with more confidence. In particular, I will intentionally duplicate some logic in this module first (e.g. timeouts) so then I can remove them from le_impl.",
      "parentUuid": "2a22edb1_82f2779c",
